<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
      .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
      .welcome-card { background: white; border: 2px solid #2d3748; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
      .welcome-title { color: #2E7D32; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
      .highlight { background-color: #e8f5e8; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #2E7D32; }
      .reward-details { background: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; }
      .voucher-code { background: #2E7D32; color: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 15px 0; }
      .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; font-size: 14px; }
      .steps { background: #e7f3ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        {{{logoHtml}}}
        <h1 style="color: white;">🎉 Welcome to Grocery App! 🎉</h1>
        <p style="color: white; font-size: 18px; margin: 0;">Your Welcome Gift is Here</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content">
        <div class="welcome-title">Welcome aboard, {{newUserName}}!</div>
        
        <p>Thank you for joining Grocery App! We're excited to have you as part of our community.</p>
        
        <div class="welcome-card">
          <h3 style="color: #2E7D32; margin-top: 0; text-align: center;">Your Welcome Gift</h3>
          
          <div class="voucher-code">
            {{welcomeVoucherCode}}
          </div>
          
          <div class="highlight">
            <h4 style="margin: 0; color: #2E7D32; text-align: center;">{{rewardDescription}}</h4>
          </div>
          
          <div class="reward-details">
            <p><strong>🎁 Reward Details:</strong></p>
            <ul style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li><strong>Discount:</strong> 10% off your first purchase</li>
              <li><strong>Minimum Purchase:</strong> Rp 50,000</li>
              <li><strong>Maximum Discount:</strong> Rp 25,000</li>
              <li><strong>Validity:</strong> 30 days from now</li>
              <li><strong>Usage:</strong> Automatically applied at checkout</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="steps">
          <p><strong>🚀 Get started with your shopping:</strong></p>
          <ol style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Verify your email address to activate your account</li>
            <li>Browse our wide selection of groceries</li>
            <li>Add items worth at least Rp 50,000 to your cart</li>
            <li>Proceed to checkout - your discount will be automatically applied!</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        
        <p><strong>💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Share your referral code with friends and earn additional 15% discounts when they join!</p>
        
        <p style="text-align: center;">
          <strong>Happy shopping! We can't wait to serve you. 🛒</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Grocery App Team</strong></p>
        <p>Need help? Contact us at support@groceryapp.com</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>